This folder is intended to contain external and internal dependencies for the project.
Initially we expect to have header only dependencies.
External dependencies will be bundled as part of the install directory.
Internal dependencies are only consumed internally and don't affect any public API.

The internal fmt headers are vendored unmodified from fmt's main branch, after
12.2.0, which includes the fix for 32-bit builds:
https://github.com/fmtlib/fmt/tree/7a3b442edc02cb45dbe60e7eaf2068356eb3f525/include/fmt
Upstream commit: 7a3b442edc02cb45dbe60e7eaf2068356eb3f525.
The upstream license is retained in internal/include/fmt/LICENSE.
